Research and demo boundary
--------------------------
This repository is a personal quantitative research workspace and public
showcase. All model slices carry an explicit `no_alpha_claim` boundary, and
historical/generated research data keeps the point-in-time and approximate-data
boundaries documented under `.agents/specs/` and
`quantlab/CORRECTNESS_CHECKLIST.md`. Nothing here is investment advice or a
representation of realized trading performance.
